 <pekka.jaaskelainen@intel.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Dec 2022 19:23:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] HIPSPV: allow SPIR-V 1.2 and emit only the necessary
 extensions

Raise the SPIR-V version cap passed to the SPIRV-LLVM-Translator from
1.1 to 1.2 so warp-level primitives (shuffles, ballots) are usable via
the subgroup extensions. Strictly the non-extension shuffle operations
would need v1.3, but no target supports it yet. At the same time,
replace --spirv-ext=+all with an explicit allowlist of the extensions
chipStar actually requires (SPV_INTEL_function_pointers,
SPV_INTEL_subgroups, SPV_EXT_shader_atomic_float_add): enabling all
translator extensions lets it emit SPIR-V that common OpenCL and
Level Zero consumers reject.

This is a merge of the former patches "Allow up to v1.2 SPIR-V
features" and "only-necessary-exts".

Applies-to: LLVM release/21.x
Upstream-Status: Equivalent change upstreamed in LLVM 23+ gated on
Triple::ChipStar (llvm#179902, commit 0c8b435c57f6).

Co-authored-by: Paulius Velesko <pvelesko@pglc.io>
---
 clang/lib/Driver/ToolChains/HIPSPV.cpp | 8 +++++---
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/clang/lib/Driver/ToolChains/HIPSPV.cpp b/clang/lib/Driver/ToolChains/HIPSPV.cpp
index 53649ca..a1a7285 100644
--- a/clang/lib/Driver/ToolChains/HIPSPV.cpp
+++ b/clang/lib/Driver/ToolChains/HIPSPV.cpp
@@ -95,9 +95,11 @@ void HIPSPV::Linker::constructLinkAndEmitSpirvCommand(
   }
 
   // Emit SPIR-V binary.
-
-  llvm::opt::ArgStringList TrArgs{"--spirv-max-version=1.1",
-                                  "--spirv-ext=+all"};
+  // We need 1.2 when using warp-level primitivies via sub group extensions.
+  // Strictly put we'd need 1.3 for the standard non-extension shuffle
+  // operations, but it's not supported by any target yet.
+  llvm::opt::ArgStringList TrArgs{"--spirv-max-version=1.2",
+                                  "--spirv-ext=-all,+SPV_INTEL_function_pointers,+SPV_INTEL_subgroups,+SPV_EXT_shader_atomic_float_add"};
   InputInfo TrInput = InputInfo(types::TY_LLVM_BC, TempFile, "");
   SPIRV::constructTranslateCommand(C, *this, JA, Output, TrInput, TrArgs);
 }
